OL,3,GNEWSAI was told my baby boy's skin was
OL,4,Aas fragile as glass
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Ciara's son Ralph was born, he had
OL,7,Fskin missing from his hands and feet.
OL,8,FDoctors said he was so fragile.
OL,10,FRalph was diagnosed with junctional
OL,11,Fepidermolysis bullosa (JEB), also known
OL,12,Fas butterfly skin, at a few days old.
OL,14,FCiara and her partner Lewis had to
OL,15,Fbecome experts in the rare genetic
OL,16,Fdisorder, which causes skin to tear or
OL,17,Fblister at the slightest touch.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
