OL,3,GNEWSAI was told my baby boy's skin was
OL,4,Aas fragile as glass
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We were new parents, we had never
OL,7,Fheard about this before and we had
OL,8,Fbasically been told my son was like
OL,9,Fglass," Ciara, from Arlesey in
OL,10,FBedfordshire, says.
